      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present the first published case in Spain on a gestant woman with acute myocardial infarction. She was angiographically studied showing a coronary artery aneurysm with inner thrombus. This is also the first time that such a lesion is described in vivo in a gestant woman."},
